      {
        "id": "_bQeLjHkr5cXF2Zu",
        "title": "Introducing Questions",
        "content": {
          "type": "Question",
          "version": 1,
          "locked": false,
          "questionId": "6UZ3R7",
          "tiles": [
            {
              "id": "document_Text_1",
              "title": "Question Prompt",
              "fixedPosition": true,
              "content": {
                "type": "Text",
                "format": "html",
                "text": [
                  "<p>Whenever you see a blue question tile like this, you know you need to answer a question.</p><p>Try it out now! Copy this to your workspace and answer the question below.</p><p>If your class is using handouts, answer this question on your handout instead!</p>"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "document_Text_2",
              "title": "Text 1",
              "content": {
                "type": "Text",
                "format": "html",
                "text": [
                  "<p>When you drag the questions tile over, you&#x27;ll be able to write your responses here.</p><p><strong>What is something that you think scientists and engineers worked together on?</strong> </p><p><strong>How do you think the scientists contributed, and how do you think the engineers contributed?</strong> </p>"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
